## Copy-Paste Examples (MCP)

**List a date window on {{USER_NAME}}'s personal calendar** (e.g. next 7 days — compute the ISO bounds from `date` first):
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__list_events
  calendarId: "{{PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ID}}"
  startTime:  "2026-06-29T00:00:00"
  endTime:    "2026-07-06T00:00:00"
  timeZone:   "{{USER_TIMEZONE}}"
  orderBy:    "startTime"
  pageSize:   50
```

**Get a single event:**
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__get_event
  calendarId: "{{PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ID}}"
  eventId:    "<eventId>"
```

**Create an event with a location** (silence notifications for a personal entry):
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__create_event
  calendarId:  "{{PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ID}}"
  summary:     "Coffee catch-up"
  startTime:   "2026-07-02T18:30:00"
  endTime:     "2026-07-02T20:30:00"
  timeZone:    "{{USER_TIMEZONE}}"
  location:    "123 Example St, Cityville, ST 00000"
  description: "Follow-up on last week's chat"
  notificationLevel: "NONE"
```

**Update an event (add location + description; everything else preserved):**
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__update_event
  calendarId:  "{{PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ID}}"
  eventId:     "<eventId>"
  location:    "123 Example Ave, Cityville, CA 94000"
  description: "Rescheduled appointment"
  notificationLevel: "NONE"
```

**Search across the calendar for a keyword:**
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__list_events
  calendarId: "{{PERSONAL_CALENDAR_ID}}"
  startTime:  "2026-06-01T00:00:00"
  endTime:    "2026-08-01T00:00:00"
  fullText:   "some-keyword"
  timeZone:   "{{USER_TIMEZONE}}"
```

**Find a free 30-min slot for {{USER_NAME}} this week (weekdays, 9–5):**
```
mcp__claude_ai_Google_Calendar__suggest_time
  attendeeEmails:  ["primary"]
  startTime:       "2026-06-29T00:00:00"
  endTime:         "2026-07-04T00:00:00"
  durationMinutes: 30
  preferences:     {startHour: "09:00", endHour: "17:00", excludeWeekends: true, pageSize: 5}
```

